# Permissions

Plans live on the **event** (`events.plan_id`), not the profile.

- Source of truth: `PLAN_ENTITLEMENTS` in `lib/permissions/entitlements.ts`
- Prices: `lib/pricing.ts` only
- Marketing bullets: `lib/plan-features.ts` (ICU placeholders from entitlements)
- Never hardcode days, GB, or `plan === "gold"` checks elsewhere

```typescript
hasFeature({ plan, feature: "schedule" });
getLimits(plan).storageBytes;
const context = await getEventPlanContext(eventId);
```

- UI (`hasFeature`, `PlanLock`): UX only
- Server actions must re-check (`checkUploadAllowed`, `getEventPlanContext` / `requireOwnedEventFeature`)
- Download window is UI-only until R2 is private + signed GET
- `setEventPlan` only when `NEXT_PUBLIC_ENABLE_PLAN_SWITCHER=true` — leave off in production

Full detail: `docs/architecture/permissions.md`
